      "content": "thanks. one thing tho—granite and marble are beautiful but i'm worried about the fine details. specifically, how do they hold up against micro-scratches or surface damage from things like grit being tracked in by people's shoes? i don't want the floor looking dull or \"chewed up\" after a year of heavy use.",
